{"product_id":"chris-ryan-extreme-silent-kill-extreme-series-4","title":"Chris Ryan Extreme: Silent Kill: Extreme Series 4","description":"\u003cp\u003eNorthern Ireland, 1993. For high-flying MI5 officer Avery Chance the real war has only just begun. When Chance is abducted by the IRA's notorious Nutting Squad, her hopes lie in the hands of a young SAS recruit who must risk everything to bring her home. Twenty years after his act of self-sacrifice in Belfast, ex-SAS legend John Bald is a scarred shadow of his former self.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 153 x 235\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Chris Ryan\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781444756876\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45538603401369,"sku":"15RD-39781444756876","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/686bbd1b2c0fd-Chris-Ryan-Extreme-Silent-Kill-Extreme-Series-4-Chris-Ryan-_1.jpg?v=1753120901","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/chris-ryan-extreme-silent-kill-extreme-series-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}